  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "The Velmori keep memory like a living grove, binding kinship, beauty, and lore into daily life.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Velmori dwell beneath high canopies and along blackwater streams, where homes are woven into roots, trunks, and earthen rises. Their clan elders preserve songs as legal records, genealogies as maps, and carved images as acts of devotion. They are patient hosts and stubborn defenders, more likely to outlast an enemy through concealment and memory than to seek glory in open battle."
